      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Yaravam (olsem tok bilong profet Akia i go long meri bilong en)",
      "rationale": "Wanwan tok i toksave long man i bin mekim nogut — yu, yu, yu."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "אחרי גוך",
      "rationale": "Tok Hibru 'bihain long bek bilong yu' i tok olsem: yu no lukluk long mi moa, yu lusim mi olgeta."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ומסכות",
      "rationale": "Em i ol piksa ol i jetim wantaim hilu paia — 'jetpela piksa' i holim piksa bilong ol i wokim long metal."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na yu mekim nogut, moa olgeta long olgeta samting i bin stap pastaim long yu, na yu go, na yu wokim bilong yu ol narapela god na ol jetpela piksa, bilong belo bilong mi, na ⟨את⟩ mi yu Thorowe mi go bihain long bek bilong yu.",
